diff --git a/docs/journal/BRAND.md b/docs/journal/BRAND.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..8eba2b390e2ed3d81e80e2e77d035c2700954b2b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/journal/BRAND.md
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+# QIK-VRT Journal — Marke und Motto
+
+## Motto
+
+> **Bewusstsein ist Wechselwirkung!**
+
+> **Consciousness is Interaction!**
+
+## Beweismotiv
+
+```text
+Effect_Ack
+Follow until
+Effect_Ack_Done
+Follow until
+Effect_Ack
+```
+
+**q.e.d. — Ingolf Lohmann**
+
+## Produktbedeutung
+
+Das Motto ist zugleich das Interaktionsprinzip des Journals: Leserinnen und Leser
+sollen eine Nachricht nicht nur konsumieren, sondern ihre Quellen, Claims,
+Versionen, Korrekturen und Auditnachweise prüfen und über das Universal-Terminal-
+Pattern weiter erkunden können.
+
+Die philosophische Aussage über Bewusstsein ist ein Autoren- und Markenmotiv.
+Sie wird nicht allein durch das technische EFFECT_ACK-Protokoll als allgemeines
+naturwissenschaftliches Gesetz bewiesen.
diff --git a/docs/journal/DELIVERY_STANDARD.md b/docs/journal/DELIVERY_STANDARD.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..c8ed65dc79904b0cf72bc89f7058553a42399d6b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/journal/DELIVERY_STANDARD.md
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# QIK-VRT Journal delivery standard
+
+Publication and email delivery are separate effects.
+
+1. Use an established authenticated sender identity.
+2. Send individually or in small relationship-based groups; do not use blind bulk delivery to unrelated recipients.
+3. Never bypass or evade recipient spam/security controls.
+4. A hard bounce closes that address until a corrected address is independently obtained.
+5. Record delivery outcome separately from content publication.
+6. Prefer one stable article URL over duplicating the full article in repeated outbound messages.
+7. For institutional recipients, prefer published editorial/submission channels and named professional contacts.
+8. Maintain deduplication so unchanged material is not repeatedly sent to the same recipient.
+9. A successful send is not a successful delivery; delivery is not reading; reading is not acceptance.
+10. Commercial mailing infrastructure, if later used, must use lawful sender identification, SPF/DKIM/DMARC, bounce handling and applicable consent/anti-spam rules.
+
+No QIK-VRT mechanism is intended to defeat recipient-side filtering.
diff --git a/docs/journal/PRIOR_ART.md b/docs/journal/PRIOR_ART.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b05d9618fa4c672c058c929f5f7bfa5a59a9a688
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/journal/PRIOR_ART.md
@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# QIK-VRT Journal — Prior-art and novelty boundary
+
+## Result
+
+`WORLD_FIRST_INTERACTIVE_NEWS_PORTAL = NOT_ESTABLISHED`
+
+That broad claim is not used as a factual publication claim.
+
+## Known earlier work
+
+1. **Journalism Trust Initiative (JTI), CWA 17493, 2019** — journalistic governance/self-assessment, publication of self-assessment and machine-readable transparency; optional external certification.
+2. **The Trust Project** — standardized transparency indicators for news, including author, type of work, references, corrections and organizational disclosures.
+3. **W3C PROV, 2013** — general machine-readable web provenance model.
+
+## QIK-VRT candidate distinction
+
+The narrower candidate novelty is the combination of:
+
+- article-level machine-readable claim classification;
+- direct binding from claims to primary evidence;
+- executable repository audit producing PASS/BLOCK;
+- effect-oriented audit semantics for AI/tool actions;
+- adapters for multiple AI coding/agent systems;
+- immutable historical article versions enforced by repository CI;
+- stable canonical URLs plus explicit correction lineage;
+- an interactive evidence browser rendered from the same claim registry;
+- explicit separation of formal mathematics, empirical physics, law, ethics, opinion and spiritual interpretation.
+
+A bounded web search on 2026-09-24 identified the prior work above but did not establish an earlier public implementation of this exact combination. Absence from a bounded search is not proof of worldwide priority.
+
+## Permitted public wording
+
+> QIK-VRT Journal combines interactive claim-level evidence inspection, executable technical audit, AI-system adapters and CI-enforced immutable article history in one publication architecture.
+
+Optional stronger wording requires a documented prior-art study and must remain qualified as a bounded-search result unless exhaustive priority evidence exists.
